# ERNIE 5.5 Flash — findings by Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B A55B

- Source: Baidu (`baidu/ernie-5.5-flash`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** ERNIE 5.5 Flash (Preview)
- **Short description:** Baidu's latest flagship Wenxin base model — 280B/14B sparse MoE with HCA and MLA-DSA attention, pre-trained on 33.5T tokens, optimized for programming, agents, knowledge work, and deep research. Supports web search. Available on Baidu Qianfan platform.
- **Provider / access:** Baidu Qianfan (`ernie-5.5-flash` / `ERNIE-5.5-Flash-Preview`), Baidu Cloud API. Pay-as-you-go billing with peak/off-peak pricing. No free tier on OpenCode Zen or OpenRouter.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date not publicly specified; pre-trained on 33.5T tokens; knowledge cutoff not publicly specified. Preview status.
- **IDs:** `baidu/ernie-5.5-flash` (Baidu Qianfan); model ID `am-abe18d298d70` in Qianfan console.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 total / 131,072 max output (per provider metadata)
- **Modalities:** Text in; text out; reasoning; tool calls; web search. Text-only (no image/audio/video input per Qianfan listing).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13, Baidu Qianfan):** Peak (8:00-22:00): Input ¥1.00/M tokens, Cache hit ¥0.10/M tokens, Output ¥4.00/M tokens. Off-peak (22:00-8:00): 50% discount. ≈ $0.14/$0.56 off-peak, $0.28/$1.13 peak (input/output). No free tier.
- **Architecture:** 280B total / 14B active sparse MoE with HCA (Hybrid Context Attention) and MLA-DSA (Multi-Head Latent Attention with Dynamic Sparse Attention); proprietary.

